Tic-Tac-Toe

A simple Tic-Tac-Toe game built with Python.

This was my first-ever programming project, created when I was just starting to learn programming. Some parts of the game are unfinished and I don't currently plan to complete them.

Technologies Used

- Python
- Tkinter
- Random
- Datetime
- JSON
- JSON Decoder
- MySQL (planned, but not implemented)

Feel free to use or modify the code if you find it useful.

This project is mainly kept as a record of my early programming journey and learning progress.